# <Feature> TanStack Invalidation Map

Use this when adding or changing mutations. Keep it near the feature query files
or copy the final table into the module/wiki note when the invalidation graph is
important.

| Mutation | Writes exact cache | Invalidates | Optimistic? | Reason |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `useUpdateDomainEntityMutation` | `QK.domain.detail(id)` | `QK.domain.lists()` | No | Server response is source of truth; list ordering/filter membership may change. |

Rules:

- Prefer targeted invalidation over global invalidation.
- Add `all`, `lists`, or `details` roots to `QK` before inventing partial keys in callsites.
- Avoid optimistic updates for regulated workflow state unless rollback is safe and obvious.
